CONTEXT Kurk IN ENGLISH
PURPOSE CONTEXT Kurk
{+ The desired system of the proof of concept in
"Data Migration under a Changing Schema in Ampersand" (RAMiCS 2024).
It differs from the existing system by one blocking invariant: `r` is total.
The system starts with an empty database.

During a migration the desired system is deployed while its new invariant does not hold yet.
The migration context includes this file with the preprocessor variable `Migrating`,
which leaves the new invariant out; the migration context states a relaxed version of it. +}

RELATION r[A*B] [UNI]
REPRESENT B TYPE ALPHANUMERIC

--#IFNOT Migrating
RULE totalR : I[A] |- r;r~
MEANING "Every A is paired with a B."
--#ENDIF

ENDCONTEXT
